➤ regexp_instr(@rs, ., 1, 0)[-5,64,0]  ¦  hex(regexp_substr(@rs, ., 1, -1))[12,6,0]  ¦  hex(regexp_replace(@rs, ., X, 1, -1))[12,38,0]  𝄀
1  ¦  C3  ¦  58A961
